    "font size" : 14.04,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Promulgation of Syllabi of Subjects in the Master Plumbing"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 29,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.0, 611.911, 243.392, 627.596 ],
    "font" : "Arial-BoldMT",
    "font size" : 14.04,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Licensure Examination"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 30,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.0, 565.958, 521.786, 588.609 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "WHEREAS, Sec. 12 of R.A. No. 1378: “The Plumbing Law” states that all applicants for registration as Master Plumber shall be required to pass the examination;"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 31,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.0, 519.982, 522.019, 554.037 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "WHEREAS Sec. 13 of the supra law provides that the scope of the examination shall consist of these subjects: Plumbing Arithmetic, Plumbing Code, Plumbing Design and Installation, Practical Problems, Oral Practical Problems and experiences;"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 32,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.0, 485.411, 521.86, 508.062 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "WHEREAS Memorandum Circular No. 08, Series of 1992 of the Commission directed every Board to prescribe and adopt a syllabus for every examination subject;"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 33,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.0, 439.436, 521.827, 473.61 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "WHEREAS every syllabus containing the concepts/topics with the corresponding level of knowledge/ proficiency shall be the basis of questions and problems that will be inputted into the question banks; and"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 34,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.0, 393.46, 521.955, 427.516 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "WHEREAS after consultation with the National Plumbers/ Plumbing Engineering Association of the Philippines, the only accredited association of the Master Plumbers/ Plumbing Engineers came out with the syllabi of the examination subjects;"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 35,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.0, 347.366, 521.865, 381.54 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "NOW, THEREFORE, by virtue of Sec. 04 and 05 of R.A. No. 1378 and Sec. 6 (a) of P.D. 223, the Board hereby RESOLVED, as it now RESOLVES, to prescribe, issue and adopt the syllabi of subjects, in the Master Plumbing Licensure Examination (annex “A”)."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 36,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.0, 301.39, 521.892, 335.565 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "FURTHER, RESOLVED, upon approval hereof by the Commission, this resolution shall be effective after fifteen (15) days following its publication in the Official Gazette or any newspapers of general circulation."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 37,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.0, 266.819, 521.858, 289.47 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "FURTHERMORE, RESOLVED, the syllabi shall be enforceable three (3) months prior to the first applicable examination schedule and upon effectivity of the herein resolution."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 38,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.0, 220.844, 521.943, 255.018 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "FINALLY, RESOLVED, that this Resolution shall be disseminated and circularized to all concerned and the accredited Association of Master Plumbing/ Plumbing Engineers (NAMPAP). Done in the City of Manila this 30th day of January, 1995."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 39,
    "page number" : 1,
